<cap:headline>River Bagmati at Benibad in Muzaffarpur district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 am today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Bagmati at Benibad in Muzaffarpur district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 am today. At 6:00 am, it was flowing at a level of 49.1 m with rising trend which is 0.42 m above its Danger Level of 48.68 m and 1.02 m below its previous HFL of 50.12 m (07/10/2025).</cap:description>
